    "description": "‘Yenduku adagam ra bhai. Adugutham, kani valle chepparu.’ ani membership leni party member la quotation lu cheppakandi.⁣\n⁣\nMana patha cinemallo chupincheru ga, pakkintodu pani manishi aina, pakintodu problems aina, mana intiki mana ontiki bhalanga bhalaanni isthai.⁣\n⁣\nAnd yes opukunta, adugutham, chala sarlu adugutham kani sagham mandhi curiosity tho adugutham, concern chupinchatam marchipotham.⁣\n⁣\nRenditi teda yendhi bey ante,⁣\n- Curiosity tho kanukuntaru, yento ani.⁣\n- Concern tho kanipetestharu, yenti ani.⁣\n⁣\nPyga single take artist la dialogue lu kodatam, ‘arey yedaina unte cheppa ra ani’, sare nalantodni nammi, oka vishyam chepthe, supreme court senior judge la yedava judgementlu pass chestham. Avathala manishiki yedaina ithe matram ‘arey naku cheppi unte, yedaina chesese vadni’ ani upanyaasalu. Endhi ra nuvu chesedi, bhiyyam rallatho upma na?⁣\n⁣\nNa kopam yekada osthadhi ante, nalanti mukku mokam teliyanodi degara ochi borewell lo kuda patanantha badhalu chepukuntaru kani telisina mokhaniki, teliyalsina prapanchaniki cheppukoru, cheppukoleru. Adhenti ante, nee kangaruni vinaleru, nee badha ni gurthinchaleru. ⁣\n⁣\nYouTube lo yours lovingly program chusthu, oka dialogue yeshnav anuko ‘Adhi vaalla balaheenatha ani? Mari balaheenatha ki nuvu bhalam avvaali kadha ra balloon?’⁣\n⁣\nChatrapathi Sivaji lago lekhapothe chakram cinema lo Prabhas lago, mari society kosam bathakakarledhu. Manam antha manchollam kuda kadhu le, just two arm distance lo unde manishiki, one arm distance ga marche nammakanni iddham. Sanka nakipokunda untam.⁣\n⁣\nCell Phone pant pocket ki matrame baruvu. Kani ee mindset unna manam, bhumike baruvu. Unta mitrama, btw I will be taking a break till November 1st week.⁣\n⁣\nPosts matram schedule chesi pedtha, kani descriptions time unte rasi pedtha. Ledha meere comment section lo raseskondi.⁣\n⁣\nP.S 1: ‘Ledhu, nenu concern thone adugutha, curiosity tho kadhu’ ani manaspurthi ga neeku anipisthe. Mitrama ninnu nuvu alage kapaduko, nalanti yentha mandhi yedavalu ochina life lo. #fakemuchatlu Jai Hind.",
